<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's TAP to fly to Bangkok.</title>
<headline>Portugal's TAP to fly to Bangkok.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese state airline TAP-Air Portugal will begin flights to Bangkok in April 1997, the airline said.</p>
<p>&quot;TAP decided to introduce from April 1997 a new destination in southeast Asia -- Bangkok -- which will be the only landing point between Lisbon and Macau,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>The route will be served by Airbus 340 planes.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
